	(text "KONTRAK FIRMWARE BARU (deviasi #2 audit — FW-SYNC; sinkron SEBELUM validasi §54):\nSensitivitas efektif = 66 mV/A x 0,6 = 39,6 mV/A (menggantikan 185 mV/A);\ntitik nol = 2,5 V x 0,6 = 1,50 V (menggantikan offset 2,5 V).\nRentang +/-30 A -> 0,312-2,688 V di node ADC (aman < 3,6 V abs.maks pin ESP32\nbahkan saat overload +40 A: 2,5+2,64=5,14 V -> x0,6 = 3,08 V).\nNilai R 1% -> akurasi attenuator memadai utk target firmware +/-5%.\nResolusi: LSB ~0,76 mV (11 dB) -> ~19 mA/LSB; span +/-30 A ~ 2.380 count.\nGATE: rasio 15/(10+15) = 0,600 TEPAT (R 10k/15k 1% — netlist proof)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 150 56 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6dd8d8ff-4085-45cc-be33-b2a82230af41")	)
	(text "J_ACS1/J_ACS2 = Dinkle DT-55-B01X-02 (blok terminal 2-pos pitch 10 mm, rating\nkelas >=30 A — PRELIM; finalisasi MPN + rating aktual di BOM S10; saran audit:\nDG301V/PT-7,5 alternatif). Jalur IP pin 1-2 (IP+) / 3-4 (IP-) = pour pendek\ndua sisi kelas HIGH_CURRENT + via stitching (disipasi 1,08 W/pkg @30 A —\naudit §11.2); TIDAK boleh lewat trace sinyal / zona digital.\nC34/C35 100nF = decouple VCC per datasheet Allegro (tambahan S3 — DN-S3-04;\ntask spec tidak menampilkannya tetapi pin VCC power_in membutuhkan bypass).\nPin 6 FILTER: NC (filter eksternal = R30/C30 di VIOUT — lihat datasheet).\nSegmen VIOUT -> R30/R31 pendek (<15 mm, kelas DEFAULT — arus ~nA)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 56 100 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4fefde7d-0b91-4652-a273-f6948b1e1ee3")	)
	(text "S9 LAYOUT (pengingat kontrak): U4/U5 dekat J_ACS1/2 di strip high-current\n(pour IP dua sisi + via stitching bawah pin IP); ACS712 & jalur attenuator\n>= 20 mm dari modul M1 (medan H switching 150 kHz) & dari antenna ESP32;\nnode ACSn_ADC + AGND lokal di zona analog; keluar ADC ke GPIO35/32 langsung.\nPemetaan kanal: ACS1 -> GPIO35 (U1.7), ACS2 -> GPIO32 (U1.8) — pin map §2.\nTP_ACS1_ADC / TP_ACS2_ADC (S7) mengetuk node ACSn_ADC di sheet 11."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 56 122 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2d784cba-f69c-41de-937e-9e4040d2db8c")	)
	(text_box "05_ACS712 — kanal arus hall-effect +/-30 A x2 + attenuator 0,6x (S3).\nU4 = ACS1 (ch1 -> GPIO35); U5 = ACS2 (ch2 -> GPIO32). ACS712ELCTR-30A-T\n  (SOIC-8, 66 mV/A, VCC = +5V, GND = AGND — audit §11.2).\nIP path per kanal: J_ACSn.1 -> pin IP+ (1,2); J_ACSn.2 -> pin IP- (3,4)\n  — pour pendek dua sisi kelas HIGH_CURRENT (1,08 W/pkg @30 A; via stitching S9).\nATTENUATOR (deviasi #5 audit): VIOUT -> R30/R31 10k 1% -> node ACSn_ADC ->\n  R32/R33 15k 1% -> AGND; C30/C31 10nF node -> AGND.\n  Rasio = 15/(10+15) = 0,600 tepat; sensitivitas efektif 39,6 mV/A; nol 1,50 V.\nPin 6 FILTER = NC. C34/C35 100nF decouple VCC (DN-S3-04).\nJ_ACS = Dinkle DT-55-B01X-02 10 mm (PRELIM S10)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(size 190 52)
		(stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type none))
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "a0bd74fe-dc08-474e-b771-95fc7d79d454")
	)
